---
description: Website architecture rules for the Mango Tree React/Vite frontend.
globs: ["web/**/*", "docs/routes.md", "docs/component-map.md", "docs/data-flow.md", "docs/api-contract.md", "docs/deployment.md"]
alwaysApply: false
---

The frontend lives under `web/` as a React/Vite SPA with TanStack Router, TanStack Query, Zustand, Tailwind CSS, and shadcn/ui. Keep routes, data flow, API contracts, component ownership, and deployment docs synchronized before expanding UI behavior. The legacy Astro skeleton should not be extended.
